# Charybdis licensing (dual structure)

This repository uses a **two-tier** license model so the navigation research stack
stays open while **defense primes and integrators** can team under clear commercial terms.

| Tier | Document | Who |
|------|----------|-----|
| **Public** | MIT below | Anyone — read, fork, study, improve the open software |
| **Prime / Program** | [LICENSE-COMMERCIAL.md](LICENSE-COMMERCIAL.md) | U.S. primes and integrators under a signed Prime Collaboration Agreement |

**Inquiry:** kylebean@fratres-x.com

