## Charybdis program notice

This repository contains **Charybdis** — hybrid navigation and terrain-aiding
**research and simulation** software for surface/submerged UUV concepts.

- Charybdis is **not** certified vehicle software, a safety controller, or evidence
  of real-world mission validation.
- Performance figures, matrices, and scenario results describe **software validation
  gates** unless a separate test report says otherwise.
- Bathymetry and sensor examples may use public or synthetic data; partner or
  classified data requires separate agreements.
- Third-party names cited in docs are for context only; no endorsement is implied.

For prime teaming, integration, or program licensing beyond MIT, see
[LICENSE-COMMERCIAL.md](LICENSE-COMMERCIAL.md) or contact Fratres X AI LLC at
kylebean@fratres-x.com.
